{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4717","id":3612863364,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7XV-uE","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4717","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4717.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4717.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4717","number":4717,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[otp field] Compose normalizeValue with validation","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #4608\n\n`normalizeValue` composes with built-in validation so callers can uppercase alphanumeric recovery codes without opting out of `validationType=\"alphanumeric\"`. OTP Field validates input before and after normalization, then queues focus and updates state with the normalized value.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Rename `sanitizeValue` to `normalizeValue` while OTP Field can still take breaking API changes.\n- Compose `normalizeValue` after whitespace and `validationType` filtering, then apply `validationType` again before clamping.\n- Remove the dev warning for combining custom normalization with built-in validation.\n- Update OTP Field docs/types/demo and add regression coverage for uppercase alphanumeric input advancing focus.\n","created_at":"2026-05-01T04:55:52Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T14:08:47Z","closed_at":"2026-05-18T14:08:43Z","merged_at":"2026-05-18T14:08:43Z","merge_commit_sha":"ccb4b307586b6549930bd6da30fd2cdcc8b45526","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"colmtuite","id":805073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTA3Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/805073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite","html_url":"https://github.com/colmtuite","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"michaldudak","id":4696105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTYxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4696105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak","html_url":"https://github.com/michaldudak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mi